            <sparkle:version>0.9.44</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.9.44</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 13:00:00 -0500</pubDate>
            <description>
                <![CDATA[
                <h3>What's New in 0.9.44:</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Contextual Initial Prompt Framing & Keyword Sanitization: Stripped metadata badges (- CR) from dynamic keywords and wrapped terms in natural sentence context to prevent Whisper prompt hallucination.</li>
                    <li>N-Gram Multi-Word Repetition & Prompt Leak Guards: Added multi-word loop and prompt leakage guards across transcription pipeline.</li>
                </ul>
                ]]>
